# Session 1 on the real KM003C (application firmware 2.0.6, bootloader 2.5),
# over bulk, one frame per line, in send/receive order:
#   CONNECT (out), ACCEPT (in),
#   memory read 0x420 / 64: request (out), confirmation (in), data (in),
#   memory read 0x4420 / 64: request (out), confirmation (in), data (in).
# Data blocks are AES-128-ECB with key slot 0. Neither info block carries a
# serial number or UID; the OTP and UID reads of that session are left out.
# source: notes/device/vectors/t12_info_auth_bulk.jsonl, frames #1..#5 and #7..#9
